== What if YAML were a complete programming language like Python?!

* ^I wrote a "figlet" in YS called `yamlet` in under 200 lines^
  * It reads FIGlet font files
  * It centers the output and prints in bright yellow

> ys yamlet.ys -f standard 'What if YAML _ ?'
> vim yamlet.ys

+* All YAMLScript is 100% valid YAML!

+* ^Codex/GPT actually wrote yamlet.ys^
  * YS has a great skill for agents
  * Works every time
  * Writes pretty good idiomatic YS code

* ^I write all my automation scripts in YS now^

